{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HAB","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"哈巴谷书","commonName":"哈巴谷书","title":"哈巴谷书","order":35,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"27e8baa39eb6443a7e10b27edb3723b342eb500d5102d70e20e335dcf084f717","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HAB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HAB/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":56},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["先知哈巴谷所得的默示。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["哈巴谷为不公平而诉苦"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"他说：耶和华啊！我呼求你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不应允，要到几时呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因强暴哀求你，你还不拯救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你为何使我看见罪孽？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你为何看着奸恶而不理呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毁灭和强暴在我面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又起了争端和相斗的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此律法放松，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公理也不显明；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恶人围困义人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以公理显然颠倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华的回答"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：你们要向列国中观看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大大惊奇；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为在你们的时候，我行一件事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽有人告诉你们，你们总是不信。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必兴起迦勒底人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是那残忍暴躁之民，通行遍地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"占据那不属自己的住处。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他威武可畏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"判断和势力都任意发出。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"他的马比豹更快，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"比晚上的豺狼更猛。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"马兵踊跃争先，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都从远方而来；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们飞跑如鹰抓食，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都为行强暴而来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"定住脸面向前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将掳掠的人聚集，多如尘沙。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们讥诮君王，笑话首领，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"嗤笑一切保障，筑垒攻取。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他以自己的势力为神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像风猛然扫过，显为有罪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["哈巴谷又向耶和华诉苦"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和华—我的 神，我的圣者啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不是从亘古而有吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们必不致死。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你派定他为要刑罚人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"磐石啊，你设立他为要惩治人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你眼目清洁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不看邪僻，不看奸恶；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行诡诈的，你为何看着不理呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恶人吞灭比自己公义的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你为何静默不语呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"你为何使人如海中的鱼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如没有管辖的爬物呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他用钩钩住，用网捕获，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用拉网聚集他们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，他欢喜快乐，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就向网献祭，向网烧香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他由此得肥美的分和富裕的食物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他岂可屡次倒空网罗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将列国的人时常杀戮，毫不顾惜呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HAB/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HAB/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NAM/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}